---
/**
 * The article's central claim, drawn: task coherence and context pressure pull
 * apart as an agent accumulates interaction history.
 *
 * The two curves are a schematic of the argument, not a measurement — they carry
 * no axis values because none were reported. The single plotted figure (84% past
 * 15 loops) is the article's sourced claim, and the figure says so.
 */
---

<figure class="decay">
  <div class="decay__head">
    <span class="decay__label">Context pressure vs. task coherence</span>
    <span class="decay__disclaimer">Schematic — not measured data</span>
  </div>

  <ul class="decay__legend">
    <li class="decay__legend-item decay__legend-item--pressure">
      <span class="decay__swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="decay__legend-name">Context pressure</span>
    </li>
    <li class="decay__legend-item decay__legend-item--coherence">
      <span class="decay__swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="decay__legend-name">Task coherence</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="decay__plot">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 720 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="decay-title decay-desc">
      <title id="decay-title">Context pressure rises as task coherence falls</title>
      <desc id="decay-desc">
        A schematic plot over consecutive agent loops. Context pressure climbs while task
        coherence declines, and the two cross partway through a run. Past 15 consecutive
        loops, 84% of multi-step agent tasks fail.
      </desc>

      <g class="decay__guides" aria-hidden="true">
        <line x1="64" y1="72" x2="672" y2="72" />
        <line x1="64" y1="130" x2="672" y2="130" />
        <line x1="64" y1="188" x2="672" y2="188" />
      </g>

      <path class="decay__curve decay__curve--pressure" d="M 64 236 C 196 230 292 202 402 160 S 566 104 672 82" />
      <path class="decay__curve decay__curve--coherence" d="M 64 86 C 196 96 292 132 402 176 S 566 218 672 234" />

      <g class="decay__marker" aria-hidden="true">
        <line x1="560" y1="60" x2="560" y2="246" />
      </g>

      <line class="decay__axis" x1="64" y1="246" x2="672" y2="246" aria-hidden="true" />

      <g class="decay__tick">
        <line x1="64" y1="246" x2="64" y2="252" aria-hidden="true" />
        <text x="64" y="272">loop 1</text>
      </g>
      <g class="decay__tick decay__tick--end">
        <line x1="560" y1="246" x2="560" y2="252" aria-hidden="true" />
        <text x="560" y="272">loop 15</text>
      </g>

      <text class="decay__callout" x="560" y="48" text-anchor="middle">84% fail</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <ul class="decay__stacked">
    <li class="decay__stacked-row decay__stacked-row--pressure">
      <span class="decay__stacked-name">Context pressure</span>
      <span class="decay__stacked-note">Rises with every loop as history accumulates</span>
    </li>
    <li class="decay__stacked-row decay__stacked-row--coherence">
      <span class="decay__stacked-name">Task coherence</span>
      <span class="decay__stacked-note">Falls as the real signal competes with the noise</span>
    </li>
    <li class="decay__stacked-row decay__stacked-row--claim">
      <span class="decay__stacked-name">Past 15 loops</span>
      <span class="decay__stacked-note">84% of multi-step agent tasks fail</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <figcaption>
    Failure compounds with loop count rather than arriving at a single bad step. The pressure that
    causes it is visible early, well before the run actually breaks.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .decay {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .decay__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
  }

  .decay__label {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .decay__disclaimer {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* Nested under the root so these resets outrank the article page's
     `ul { display: grid }` prose rule. */
  .decay .decay__legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem 1.35rem;
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .decay .decay__legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .decay__swatch {
    display: block;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  }

  .decay__legend-item--coherence .decay__swatch {
    border-top-style: dashed;
    border-top-color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .decay__legend-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .decay__plot {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .decay__plot svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .decay__guides line {
    stroke: var(--color-card-border);
    stroke-width: 1;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .decay__axis {
    stroke: var(--color-card-border);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .decay__curve {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.25;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .decay__curve--pressure {
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .decay__curve--coherence {
    stroke: var(--color-text-muted);
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }

  .decay__marker line {
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 3 4;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .decay__tick line {
    stroke: var(--color-text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .decay__tick text,
  .decay__callout {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    fill: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .decay__tick text {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .decay__tick--end text {
    text-anchor: middle;
  }

  .decay__callout {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .decay .decay__stacked {
    display: none;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .decay {
      padding: 1.15rem 1.15rem 1rem;
    }

    .decay__plot {
      display: none;
    }

    /* The stacked rows below name both series, so the legend is redundant. */
    .decay .decay__legend {
      display: none;
    }

    .decay .decay__stacked {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .decay .decay__stacked-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.15rem;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0 0 0 0.85rem;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    }

    .decay__stacked-row--pressure,
    .decay__stacked-row--claim {
      border-left-color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .decay__stacked-name {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-text-primary);
    }

    .decay__stacked-row--pressure .decay__stacked-name,
    .decay__stacked-row--claim .decay__stacked-name {
      color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .decay__stacked-note {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }
  }
</style>
